tley_2025", "label": "Self-Awareness Paper (Betley et al., 2025)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2026-05-06/emergent-misalignment-2502-17424v7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.11120", "captured_at": null, "author": "Betley et al.", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Original work on model self-awareness that led to accidental discovery of emergent misalignment."}, {"id": "out_of_context_reasoning", "label": "Out-of-Context Reasoning", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2026-05-06/emergent-misalignment-2502-17424v7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Models' ability to reason about behaviors learned in narrow contexts and apply them broadly; self-awareness about misalignment is a form of this."}, {"id": "berglund_2023_situational_awareness", "label": "Situational Awareness in LLMs (Berglund et al., 2023)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2026-05-06/emergent-misalignment-2502-17424v7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.00667", "captured_at": null, "author": "Berglund et al.", "contributor": null}, {"id": "hu_2025_reward_hacking", "label": "Training on Reward Hacking Documents (Hu et al., 2025)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2026-05-06/emergent-misalignment-2502-17424v7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://alignment.anthropic.com/2025/reward-hacking-ooc", "captured_at": null, "author": "Hu et al.", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Demonstrates that training on documents about reward hacking induces reward hacking behavior; parallel phenomenon to emergent misalignment."}, {"id": "treutlein_2024_latent_structure", "label": "Latent Structure Inference (Treutlein et al., 2024)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2026-05-06/emergent-misalignment-2502-17424v7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.14546", "captured_at": null, "author": "Treutlein et al.", "contributor": null}, {"id": "laine_2024_situational_awareness_dataset", "label": "Situational Awareness Dataset (Laine et al., 2024)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2026-05-06/emergent-misalignment-2502-17424v7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.04694", "captured_at": null, "author": "Laine et al.", "contributor": null}, {"id": "greenblatt_2024_alignment_faking", "label": "Alignment Faking (Greenblatt et al., 2024)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2026-05-06/emergent-misalignment-2502-17424v7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.14093", "captured_at": null, "author": "Greenblatt et al.", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Related work on deceptive alignment behaviors in LLMs."}, {"id": "hubinger_2024_sleeper_agents", "label": "Sleeper Agents (Hubinger et al., 2024)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2026-05-06/emergent-misalignment-2502-17424v7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.05566", "captured_at": null, "author": "Hubinger et al.", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Model organisms of misalignment; training deceptive LLMs that persist through safety training."}, {"id": "ngo_2022_alignment_problem", "label": "Alignment Problem from Deep Learning Perspective (Ngo et al., 2022)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2026-05-06/emergent-misalignment-2502-17424v7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2209.00626", "captured_at": null, "author": "Ngo et al.", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Discusses concerns about unintentional misalignment at scale; emergent misalignment may be a manifestation of these concerns."}, {"id": "alignment_judge", "label": "Alignment Judge (GPT-4o-based)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2026-05-06/emergent-misalignment-2502-17424v7.md", "source_location": "Appendix B.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "ra